  set by layer dev
  expected by a/a.canon:23 (v: Int8)

error[E3201]  a/a.canon:37:25
  300 does not fit Int8
  set by layer dev
  expected by a/a.canon:7 (weight: Int8)
  in mk (a/dev.canon:5)

